{"step_index":131,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-18T18:17:56Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Building & Inventory**\n\nI'm focusing now on a comprehensive inventory of the remaining features and polish, given the connection issues. We can construct everything possible right now, deferring the connection testing to a later stage.\n\n\n**Refining Vision & Dialer**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the enhancements for both the OCR/Vision lead extractor and the Power Dialer. Specifically, I'm prioritizing multi-page document support, column auto-detection with custom mapping, duplicate phone number detection, and a solid fallback mechanism for CSV/Excel/VCF imports. Simultaneously, I'm working to integrate call disposition history, contact profile editing within the HUD, call recording with timestamp tracking, and a one-tap DNC feature for streamlined unsubscribe management.\n\n\n**Developing Multi-Touch Sequences**\n\nNow I'm diving into the specifics of the multi-touch sequences. I'm focusing on \"Step 2 of 4 (SMS trigger on next no-answer)\" visuals and custom presets for voicemail/SMS drops. The screen layout for the Lead Detail page is becoming clearer, as I determine where to put the timeline and action buttons. The visual drag/reorder steps for the cadence builder, plus smart delay logic, are being prioritized next.\n\n\n**Implementing Feature Updates**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in implementing the recent feature updates. I'm focusing on the global settings and secure API key storage to enhance usability. Specifically, I'm working to add user profile settings for template personalization, alongside auto-advance delay configurations. These are being built on a foundation of secure database storage, extending existing data models to add multi-page support, DNC features, custom tags, and new settings types to the database.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"export type CallDisposition =\n  | 'pending'\n  | 'connected'\n  | 'no_answer'\n  | 'voicemail'\n  | 'bad_number'\n  | 'do_not_call'\n  | 'callback_requested';\n\nexport interface Lead {\n  id: string;\n  list_id: string;\n  name: string;\n  phone: string;\n  company?: string;\n  email?: string;\n  notes?: string;\n  cadence_step: number;\n  last_attempt_at?: string | null;\n  last_disposition?: CallDisposition | null;\n  attempts_count: number;\n  tags?: string[];\n  created_at: string;\n  updated_at: string;\n}\n\nexport interface LeadList {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  source_image_uri?: string | null;\n  total_leads: number;\n  completed_leads: number;\n  connected_leads: number;\n  created_at: string;\n  updated_at: string;\n}\n\nexport interface CallLog {\n  id: string;\n  lead_id: string;\n  list_id: string;\n  timestamp: string;\n  duration_seconds: number;\n  disposition: CallDisposition;\n  note?: string;\n  sms_sent: boolean;\n  sms_body?: string;\n}\n\nexport interface CadenceRule {\n  id: string;\n  step_number: number;\n  condition_disposition: CallDisposition | 'any_unconnected';\n  action_type: 'call_only' | 'call_and_sms' | 'sms_only';\n  sms_template_id?: string | null;\n  delay_hours: number;\n}\n\nexport interface SMSTemplate {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  body: string; // supports {{name}}, {{company}}, {{my_name}}, {{notes}}\n}\n\nexport interface ExtractedLeadItem {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  phone: string;\n  company?: string;\n  email?: string;\n  notes?: string;\n  isDuplicate?: boolean;\n  isValid: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface AppSettings {\n  gemini_api_key?: string;\n  user_name: string;\n  auto_advance_seconds: number;\n  auto_advance_enabled: boolean;\n  dnc_phone_numbers: string[];\n}\n","Description":"Extended TypeScript types with AppSettings, DNC, and multi-template support","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\src\\types\\index.ts","toolAction":"Updating types","toolSummary":"Update core 